hemical solutions, Select places the utmost importance on safe, environmentally responsible management of water throughout the lifecycle of a well. Additionally, Select believes that responsibly managing water resources throughout its operations to help conserve and protect the environment is paramount to the Company’s continued success. For more information, please visit Select’s website, https://www.selectwater.com.","context":"About Select Water Solutions, Inc.","section":"Business Segment Information","block":45,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001140361-26-031155","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-04","reportDate":"2026-08-04","cik":"0001693256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1693256/000114036126031155/ef20079476_ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/65eb8a2270f8563c4ca0c321a47161bd7b39d8112ecb0a38d988c6479748675b.bin","sha256":"65eb8a2270f8563c4ca0c321a47161bd7b39d8112ecb0a38d988c6479748675b"}},{"id":"261499c6d607e88cee024b9328d244a841c46632df661b58bae7c2145658fb39","quote":"Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements","context":"6","section":"Business Segment Information","block":47,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001140361-26-031155","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-04","reportDate":"2026-08-04","cik":"0001693256","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1693256/000114036126031155/ef20079476_ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/65eb8a2270f8563c4ca0c321a47161bd7b39d8112ecb0a38d988c6479748675b.bin","sha256":"65eb8a2270f8563c4ca0c321a47161bd7b39d8112ecb0a38d988c6479748675b"}},{"id":"e4f01963ae6c3cdf2b8fbc9f2888a48f30317ac96f7c5c7b38ea669098d4bc2d","quote":"All statements in this communication other than statements of historical facts are forward-looking statements which contain our current expectations about our future results. We have attempted 